{
  "nodes": [
    { "id": "g-data", "type": "group", "x": -5200, "y": -1800, "width": 1400, "height": 2800, "label": "Datove zdroje (Files)", "color": "3" },
    { "id": "g-frontend", "type": "group", "x": -3600, "y": -1800, "width": 3200, "height": 2800, "label": "Frontend (React + TypeScript + Vite)", "color": "5" },
    { "id": "g-backend", "type": "group", "x": -200, "y": -1800, "width": 3200, "height": 3200, "label": "Backend (Node.js + Express)", "color": "4" },
    { "id": "g-external", "type": "group", "x": 3200, "y": -1800, "width": 1200, "height": 1800, "label": "Externi API / Knihovny", "color": "6" },

    { "id": "n-master-csv", "type": "text", "x": -5100, "y": -1600, "width": 900, "height": 100, "text": "## master-data.csv\n~50 000+ artiklů, windows-1250 — Hlavni DB Usti" },
    { "id": "n-effi-csv", "type": "text", "x": -5100, "y": -1460, "width": 900, "height": 100, "text": "## master-data-effi.csv\nEFI DB (opt-in, dataSource='effi'/'both')" },
    { "id": "n-wires-json", "type": "text", "x": -5100, "y": -1320, "width": 900, "height": 100, "text": "## wires.json\n639 artiklů vodičů — public/ + DATA_DIR (prurez, barva, skupina)" },
    { "id": "n-cables-json", "type": "text", "x": -5100, "y": -1180, "width": 900, "height": 100, "text": "## cables.json\nKabely DB — public/ + DATA_DIR (pocetZil, stineni, multi-value |||)" },
    { "id": "n-kanban-json", "type": "text", "x": -5100, "y": -1040, "width": 900, "height": 100, "text": "## kanban.json\n517 artiklů sypkého materiálu — public/ + DATA_DIR (z Kanban_DB.xlsx)" },
    { "id": "n-snapshots", "type": "text", "x": -5100, "y": -900, "width": 900, "height": 100, "text": "## DATA_DIR/.snapshots/\nGFS zálohy — vše 5 dní / týdně 3 týdny / měsíčně 1 měsíc" },
    { "id": "n-audit-log", "type": "text", "x": -5100, "y": -760, "width": 900, "height": 100, "text": "## DATA_DIR/.audit.jsonl\nAdmin audit log — save/snapshot/restore/master-csv" },
    { "id": "n-chats-log", "type": "text", "x": -5100, "y": -620, "width": 900, "height": 100, "text": "## server/logs/chats.jsonl\nAI chat logy — collector.js (JSONL append, nejnovější první)" },

    { "id": "n-app", "type": "text", "x": -3500, "y": -1600, "width": 1380, "height": 200, "text": "## App.tsx — Root komponenta\n**State:** articles[], results[], zbomTabs[], AppMode, DataSource, selectedManufacturers[]\n**Logika:** debounced search (1500ms delay), CSV loading na mount/source switch, mode switching\n**Persistence:** zbomTabs + lastMode v localStorage — ZBOM_TABS_KEY, ZBOM_ACTIVE_KEY\n**DataSource:** usti | effi | both → loadCSV() + loadWiresRaw() merge (dedup by artikl)" },
    { "id": "n-types", "type": "text", "x": -3500, "y": -1360, "width": 680, "height": 180, "text": "## src/types.ts — Core typy\nArticle { typoveOznaceni, artikl, vyrobce, nazev,\n  cisloDiluVyrobce, vybehovyDil, status,\n  prurez?, barva?, skupina? }\nSearchResult extends Article { score, matchType, highlightedFields }\nBomRow { id, type('L'|'T'), artikl, popis, mnozstvi }\nAppMode = 'single'|'bulk'|'ai'|'wirecable'|'kanban'|'admin'\nDataSource = 'usti'|'effi'|'both'" },
    { "id": "n-search-engine", "type": "text", "x": -2780, "y": -1360, "width": 680, "height": 180, "text": "## src/utils/searchEngine.ts — Klientský vyhledávač\nFuse.js fuzzy (threshold=0.3, includeScore) + regex wildcard + combined\nremoveDiacritics() — lišta → lista\ncalculateScore() → matchType: exact|minimal|medium|large\nsearchSuggestions() — typo-corrected fallback\nVýsledek: SearchResult[] (score 0–100, highlightedFields)" },

    { "id": "n-csv-parser", "type": "text", "x": -3500, "y": -1140, "width": 680, "height": 180, "text": "## src/utils/csvParser.ts — Data loading\nloadCSV() — windows-1250 + UTF-8 auto-detect\nloadWiresRaw() → Article[] (s prurez/barva/skupina)\nloadCables() → CableArticle[]\nloadKanban() → KanbanArticle[]\nPreference: GET /api/db/:name → fallback public/ JSON\nloadSchema(name) → DbSchema pro dynamické filtry" },
    { "id": "n-utils-other", "type": "text", "x": -2780, "y": -1140, "width": 680, "height": 180, "text": "## Další utils\nbomExport.ts — BOM TXT/Excel export, CP1250 encoding\n  buildImportResult(BomResultRow[]) → ImportResult\ndbSchema.ts — DbSchema/DbColumn typy, inferSchema,\n  applyDynamicFilters(), cellToFilterString()\nadminApi.ts — admin API klient: login, fetchDb,\n  saveDb, listDatabases (sessionStorage pw)\ndbCsv.ts — CSV parse/serialize + download helper\nexcelHandler.ts — Excel file import/export" },

    { "id": "n-single-mode", "type": "text", "x": -3500, "y": -920, "width": 680, "height": 160, "text": "## Mod: Single search\nSearchBar.tsx — query, mode, field, maxResults selectors\nFilterPanel.tsx — výrobce chip filtry (z top 200 výsledků)\nResultCard.tsx — artikl karta: badges, status, highlighted\nDisplayedCount — paginate +3 na kliknutí\nDynamicFilters.tsx — chip filtry dle schématu (filterable:true)" },
    { "id": "n-bulk-mode", "type": "text", "x": -2780, "y": -920, "width": 680, "height": 160, "text": "## Mod: Bulk search (BulkSearch.tsx)\nMulti-line query input nebo CSV upload\nSelectableCard.tsx — výběrové výsledkové karty\nonOpenInZbom(bulkResults, selections) callback\n→ App.tsx vytvoří novou ZBOM záložku s daty\nAltQuery fallback, pocet/oznaceniPristroje parsing" },

    { "id": "n-ai-chat", "type": "text", "x": -3500, "y": -720, "width": 680, "height": 180, "text": "## Mod: AI — Karel Bot (AiChat.tsx)\nSSE stream: POST /api/chat\nZobrazuje: status log kroků (expand/search/synthesize)\nSession persistence v localStorage (history, model)\nComponentAdvisor toggle → productKnowledge inject\nModely: small (výchozí) / medium (kvalitnější)\nChatBot.tsx — floating chat button (pokud BACKEND_URL)" },
    { "id": "n-ai-guided", "type": "text", "x": -2780, "y": -720, "width": 680, "height": 180, "text": "## Mod: AI — Řízeny mod (GuidedSearch.tsx)\nSSE stream: POST /api/guided-chat\nFáze UI: initial → questions form → results\nbadge: Doporučeno (bg-green)\nSession persistence, obnovitelný stav\nAiOnboarding.tsx — 5-krokový průvodce při prvním vstupu\n(localStorage key: ai-onboarding-v1)" },

    { "id": "n-bom-builder-ui", "type": "text", "x": -3500, "y": -500, "width": 680, "height": 180, "text": "## Mod: AI — BOM Builder BETA (AiBomBuilder.tsx)\nState machine: input → processing → post_check → clarifying → results\nPre-check: POST /api/bom-check (JSON, před spuštěním)\nBuild: POST /api/bom-build (SSE, progress per řádek)\nPost-check: POST /api/bom-post-check (≥3 nenalezených)\nBOM History v localStorage (max 5, cache key = rows+prefs)" },
    { "id": "n-zbom", "type": "text", "x": -2780, "y": -500, "width": 680, "height": 180, "text": "## ZBOM záložky + Editor\nZbomEditor.tsx — SAP ZBOM formát (L=materiál, T=text)\nBomWizard.tsx — L/T řádky editor, editable cells\nBomHeader: cisloVrcholu, cisloZavodu, platnostOd (DDMMYYYY),\n  popis (max 40 zn.), status, vyrobniDispecer\nExport: TXT (CP1250) + Excel\nImport: ExcelImport.tsx (xlsx upload → BomRow[])" },

    { "id": "n-wirecable-mode", "type": "text", "x": -3500, "y": -280, "width": 680, "height": 140, "text": "## Mod: Vodice & Kabely (WireCableSearch.tsx)\nDynamicFilters — chip filtry ze schématu (filterable:true)\nKřížová záložka, cross-tab navigace\nNačítá: GET /api/db/wires + GET /api/db/cables\nWire karty: badge Vodic DB + prurez/barva" },
    { "id": "n-kanban-mode", "type": "text", "x": -2780, "y": -280, "width": 680, "height": 140, "text": "## Mod: Kanban — Sypky material (KanbanSearch.tsx)\nKATEGORIE matchery nad sloupcem Skupina → podskupiny\nFiltry: Provedení, Barva dle DIN, Kanban\nNačítá: GET /api/db/kanban\nBarva theme: peach, data se NEMERGUJÍ do hlavní DB" },

    { "id": "n-admin-mode", "type": "text", "x": -3500, "y": -100, "width": 680, "height": 220, "text": "## Mod: Admin (AdminPanel.tsx)\nAuth: x-admin-password header → sessionStorage pw\nSub-nav: Databáze / AI logy / Hlavní DB / Zálohy\nDataGrid.tsx — Excel-like CRUD\n  Shift+drag výběr, Ctrl+C → TSV, Ctrl+V z Excelu\n  Ctrl+Z undo (stack 50), dvojklik/Enter editace\n  Del maže, sort kliknutím na hlavičku\nModal validace před uložením (duplicity, typy)" },
    { "id": "n-admin-sub", "type": "text", "x": -2780, "y": -100, "width": 680, "height": 220, "text": "## Admin sub-komponenty\nAdminLogs.tsx — prohlížeč chat/guided/bom logů\n  GET /api/admin/logs?type=&limit=\nAdminMasterCsv.tsx — base64 upload → reloadMaster()\n  PUT /api/admin/master-csv/:which\nAdminBackups.tsx — snapshoty + audit log\n  GET/POST /api/admin/snapshots/:name\n  POST /api/admin/snapshots/:name/restore/:id\n_poznamka — interni klic, žlutý sloupec v gridu" },

    { "id": "n-ui-extras", "type": "text", "x": -3500, "y": 160, "width": 1380, "height": 140, "text": "## UI extras\nAppOnboarding.tsx — 5-krokový průvodce při prvním spuštění (app-onboarding-v1)\nChangelog.tsx — verze VDDMMYY (V070626 = 7. 6. 2026), modal\nHowItWorks.tsx — modal Jak funguju? (aktualizovat při nové funkci)\nVersionChecker.tsx — auto-check nové verze\nInstallPrompt.tsx — PWA install prompt\nTooltip.tsx — reusable tooltip komponenta" },

    { "id": "n-express", "type": "text", "x": -100, "y": -1600, "width": 1380, "height": 200, "text": "## server/src/index.js — Express Server\nMiddleware: cors, json body-parser, checkAdmin (x-admin-password header)\nGET /health → { status: 'ok' }\nGET /api/version → APP_VERSION\nGET /api/db → [{ name, label, idKey }] — seznam databází\nGET /api/db/:name → { rows (stripInternal), schema } — veřejná data\nGET /api/db/:name/schema → jen schéma (pro DynamicFilters)\nGET /api/guided-categories → COMPONENT_CATEGORIES seznam\nADMIN_PASSWORD env: bez něj admin endpointy vrací 503, UI skryje admin záložku" },

    { "id": "n-sse-chat", "type": "text", "x": -100, "y": -1360, "width": 680, "height": 160, "text": "## POST /api/chat → SSE\nBody: { message, history[], webSearchEnabled, synthModel }\nEvents:\n  status { step:'expand', terms[], manufacturer }\n  status { step:'search', candidates[] }\n  status { step:'synthesize' }\n  result { answer, selected[], refinement }\n  error { error }\n→ handleChat() → collector.logRecord({type:'chat'})" },
    { "id": "n-sse-bom", "type": "text", "x": 620, "y": -1360, "width": 680, "height": 160, "text": "## POST /api/bom-build → SSE\nBody: { rows[], preferences, answers? }\nEvents:\n  progress { rowIndex, total, typoveOznaceni, status }\n    status: waiting|searching|found|not_found|skipped|knowledge\n  result { bomRows, toCreate, produktovaHierarchie, artiklVrcholu }\n  error { error }\n→ handleBomBuild() → collector.logRecord({type:'bom'})" },

    { "id": "n-sse-guided", "type": "text", "x": -100, "y": -1160, "width": 680, "height": 140, "text": "## POST /api/guided-chat → SSE\nBody: { message, phase, answers?, category? }\nEvents:\n  update { phase, category, questions[] }\n  progress { candidates[] }\n  result { answer, articles, expandedTerms, phase }\n→ handleGuidedChat() → collector.logRecord({type:'guided'})" },
    { "id": "n-json-bom", "type": "text", "x": 620, "y": -1160, "width": 680, "height": 140, "text": "## JSON BOM endpointy\nPOST /api/bom-check\n  Body: { rows[], preferences }\n  → checkClarification() — pre-search AI check\n  Response: { needsClarification, questions[] }\nPOST /api/bom-post-check\n  → postCheckClarification(notFoundRows) — ≥3 nenalezených\n  Response: { needsClarification, questions[] }" },

    { "id": "n-admin-endpoints", "type": "text", "x": -100, "y": -980, "width": 1380, "height": 220, "text": "## Admin API endpointy (vyžaduji x-admin-password)\nPOST /api/admin/login → ověření hesla (200/401)\nGET  /api/admin/db/:name → plná data vč. _poznamka (readRows)\nPUT  /api/admin/db/:name → uložení rows+schema → snapshotDb → writeRows → notifyReload → appendAudit\nGET  /api/admin/snapshots/:name → [{ id, ts, size }] seznam\nPOST /api/admin/snapshots/:name → ruční vytvoření\nPOST /api/admin/snapshots/:name/restore/:id → restore (nejdřív záloha aktuálního stavu)\nGET  /api/admin/audit → audit log (readAudit)\nGET  /api/admin/logs?type=chat|guided|bom&limit= → AI logy z chats.jsonl\nGET  /api/admin/master-csv → { size, count } info\nPUT  /api/admin/master-csv/:which → base64 upload → write DATA_DIR → reloadMaster()\nGET  /api/admin/master-csv/:which/download → stažení" },

    { "id": "n-chat-js", "type": "text", "x": -100, "y": -720, "width": 1380, "height": 220, "text": "## server/src/chat.js — Karel Bot logika\nModel expand: mistral-small-latest → JSON { type, terms[], manufacturer }\nModel synth: mistral-small-latest (default) nebo mistral-medium-latest (toggle)\nFáze:\n  1. handleExpand(message, history) → rozpozná intent\n     type='search' → searchDB(terms, manufacturer)\n     type='web_search' → Mistral web search plugin\n  2. isWireCableQuery() → přesměruje na searchWires() nebo searchCables()\n  3. handleSynthesize(candidates) → SSE token-by-token stream\nKontext: ABBREVIATIONS_CONTEXT + MANUFACTURER_DOCS + buildKnowledgeContext(productKnowledge)" },

    { "id": "n-bom-builder-js", "type": "text", "x": -100, "y": -460, "width": 1380, "height": 240, "text": "## server/src/bomBuilder.js — AI BOM Builder\nWorker pool: max 10 paralelně (konstanta CONCURRENCY=10)\nPer řádek pipeline:\n  1. resolveManufacturerKey(typoveOznaceni) → normalize název výrobce\n  2. searchTerm() — round 1 — top 5 kandidátů\n  3. pickBestMatch(candidates) → Mistral vybere nejlepší artikl (type L)\n  4. round 2 if not found → alternativní termíny\n  5. deriveDescription(typoveOznaceni, mfrDoc) → max 40 zn, vrátí '' pokud AI není jistá\nVýsledkové typy:\n  type:'L' — BomResultRow (nalezený artikl, aiFilledPopis=true pokud AI doplnila)\n  type:'T' — ToCreateRow (nenalezený → K-Zalozeni tabulka)\nfunctions: checkClarification, postCheckClarification" },

    { "id": "n-guided-js", "type": "text", "x": -100, "y": -180, "width": 1380, "height": 240, "text": "## server/src/guidedSearch.js — Řízeny vyhledávač\nFáze: initial → questioning → searching → results\n1. detectCategory(message) — Mistral + keyword match → componentGuide kategorie\n2. generateQuestions(category) — Mistral vygeneruje 5-7 specifických otázek\n3. generateSearchTerms(category, answers, mfrKey) → 20-35 termínů (Mistral)\n4. executeTerm(term, field, limit) per termín:\n   → searchTerm() z master CSV\n   → nebo filterCables(answers) / filterWires(answers) pro kabelové kategorie\n5. synthesizeResults(allCandidates, answer) → top 5-8, Mistral vysvětlí výběr\nKdyž DB nenajde nic → AI doporučí typové označení z knowledge báze kategorie" },

    { "id": "n-search-js", "type": "text", "x": -100, "y": 100, "width": 680, "height": 220, "text": "## server/src/search.js — Master CSV search\nAlgoritmus (prioritní pořadí): Wildcard > Fuzzy > BM25\n\nWildcard: každé slovo musí matchovat (regex, score=1.0)\nFuzzy: Fuse.js threshold=0.3, score=1−fuzzScore\nBM25: IDF × tf×(K1+1)/(tf+K1×(1−B+B×dl/avgDL))\n  K1=1.5, B=0.75, AND sémantika (všechny tokeny musí být)\n  Indexovaná pole: nazev, typoveOznaceni, artikl, vyrobce, cisloDiluVyrobce\n  Tokeny: bez diakritiky, lowercase, min 2 znaky\nreloadMaster() — volá se po admin upload nového CSV" },
    { "id": "n-wire-cable-search", "type": "text", "x": 620, "y": 100, "width": 680, "height": 220, "text": "## server/src/wireSearch.js\nBM25 index pro vodiče (vč. prurez, barva, skupina)\nsearchWires(query, topN, mfrFilter) → ranked results\nfilterWires(answers) — strukturální filtr dle polí\nreloadWires() — registruje se přes registerReload('wires', fn)\n\n## server/src/cableSearch.js\nfilterCables(answers, dropKeys) — strukturální filtr\nMulti-value parsing |||: pocetZil, prurez, stineni\nBoolean fields: stineni, pletezenePary, retiez, olej,\n  bezhalogenovy → ANO/NE\nProgresivní uvolňování: dropKeys retry (méně kritérií)" },

    { "id": "n-datastore-js", "type": "text", "x": -100, "y": 360, "width": 1380, "height": 220, "text": "## server/src/dataStore.js — Admin DB store\nDATABASES registry: wires (idKey='artiklStroj'), cables (idKey='artikl'), kanban (idKey='artikl')\nreadRows(name) / writeRows(name, rows) — atomický zápis přes .tmp + rename\nreadSchema(name) / writeSchema(name, schema)\ninferSchema(rows) — auto-detekce typů sloupců (text/number/boolean); _prefix klíče ignoruje\nreconcileSchema(schema, rows) — merge persistovaného schématu + nových klíčů z dat\nsnapshotDb(name) → .snapshots/<name>/<ISO>.json + GFS pruneSnapshots()\nlistSnapshots / readSnapshot / restoreSnapshot\nregisterReload(name, fn) — wireSearch/cableSearch se registrují\nnotifyReload(name) — voláno po každém writeRows()\nappendAudit(entry) / readAudit(limit) → .audit.jsonl" },

    { "id": "n-knowledge-js", "type": "text", "x": -100, "y": 620, "width": 1380, "height": 200, "text": "## Knowledge soubory\nserver/src/manufacturers.js (31KB)\n  resolveManufacturerKey(text) — normalizace názvu výrobce z typového označení\n  resolveManufacturersByCategory(category) — výrobci pro kategorii\n  MANUFACTURER_DOCS — plné docs výrobců (LAPP, Helukabel, HUBER+SUHNER, Nexans, WAGO, Phoenix Contact...)\n\nserver/src/productKnowledge.js (125KB) — hierarchická báze: kategorie → výrobci → produktové řady\n  buildKnowledgeContext(message, manufacturer) → inject do chat.js + bomBuilder.js\n\nserver/src/componentGuide.js (114KB) — COMPONENT_CATEGORIES[]\n  { key, label, aliases[], questions[], knowledge, examples } per kategorie\n  Používá: guidedSearch.js (detectCategory, generateSearchTerms)\n\nserver/src/abbreviations.js — průmyslové zkratky (MCC, PLC, B1, ...) inject do chat.js" },

    { "id": "n-collector-js", "type": "text", "x": -100, "y": 860, "width": 680, "height": 120, "text": "## server/src/collector.js — JSONL logování\nappendRecord(type, data) → atomic JSONL append\nVolají: chat.js, guidedSearch.js, bomBuilder.js\nLoguje: type='chat'|'guided'|'bom' + message/rows/result\nČte: GET /api/admin/logs?type=&limit= (nejnovější první)" },
    { "id": "n-deploy", "type": "text", "x": 620, "y": 860, "width": 680, "height": 120, "text": "## Deployment\nDocker: DATA_DIR=/app/data perzistentní volume (./data:/app/data)\nentrypoint.sh — seed dat ONLY IF chybí (přežije restart)\nGitHub Actions: backup-databases.yml (cron 02:00 UTC)\n  → GET /api/db/:name → commit public/*.json + *.schema.json" },

    { "id": "n-mistral", "type": "text", "x": 3300, "y": -1600, "width": 1000, "height": 220, "text": "## Mistral AI (@mistralai/mistralai SDK)\n**mistral-small-latest:**\n  chat.js — expand query → { type, terms[], manufacturer }\n  bomBuilder.js — pickBestMatch(), deriveDescription()\n  guidedSearch.js — detectCategory(), generateQuestions(),\n    generateSearchTerms(), synthesizeResults()\n\n**mistral-medium-latest:**\n  chat.js — Karel Bot synthesize (výchozí volba v UI)\n  Toggle v AiChat.tsx (model choice)\n\nVolitelné: Mistral web search plugin (webSearchEnabled=true)" },
    { "id": "n-fuse-js", "type": "text", "x": 3300, "y": -1340, "width": 1000, "height": 120, "text": "## Fuse.js — Fuzzy vyhledávání\nKlient (searchEngine.ts): threshold=0.3, includeScore=true\nServer (search.js): fuzzySearch(), threshold=0.3\nDiacritikou-odolné — removeDiacritics() před indexací i query" },
    { "id": "n-sse-proto", "type": "text", "x": 3300, "y": -1180, "width": 1000, "height": 160, "text": "## SSE Protokol (Server-Sent Events)\nFormát: 'event: <type>\\ndata: {...}\\n\\n'\nFrontend: fetch() + ReadableStream + TextDecoder\nEvent typy: status | result | progress | update | error\nEndpointy: /api/chat, /api/bom-build, /api/guided-chat\nKnowledge eventy (status:'knowledge') → extra položky v progressItems,\n  ne update existujícího řádku" },
    { "id": "n-gh-actions", "type": "text", "x": 3300, "y": -980, "width": 1000, "height": 140, "text": "## GitHub Actions (CI/CD)\n.github/workflows/backup-databases.yml\n  cron: 02:00 UTC + ruční spuštění\n  Stáhne GET /api/db/:name (wires/cables/kanban)\n  Commit public/<name>.json + <name>.schema.json\n  Pojistka: 0 řádků → soubor se nepřepíše\n  Secret: VITE_BACKEND_URL" }
  ],

  "edges": [
    { "id": "e-master-to-parser", "fromNode": "n-master-csv", "toNode": "n-csv-parser", "label": "loadCSV()" },
    { "id": "e-effi-to-parser", "fromNode": "n-effi-csv", "toNode": "n-csv-parser", "label": "loadCSV()" },
    { "id": "e-wires-to-parser", "fromNode": "n-wires-json", "toNode": "n-csv-parser", "label": "loadWiresRaw()" },
    { "id": "e-cables-to-parser", "fromNode": "n-cables-json", "toNode": "n-csv-parser", "label": "loadCables()" },
    { "id": "e-kanban-to-parser", "fromNode": "n-kanban-json", "toNode": "n-csv-parser", "label": "loadKanban()" },
    { "id": "e-parser-to-app", "fromNode": "n-csv-parser", "toNode": "n-app", "label": "setArticles()" },
